<h1 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0.67em 0 20px;">Support the Casey Family Pledge and Champions for PLAY!</h1>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">The Brian S. Casey Family Memorial Fund was established to honor Brian and his 19-year-old daughter, Megan, who tragically lost their lives in a plane crash in 2016. Brian was a strong believer in the PLAY program and served on the PLAY Golf Committee for many years. His wife, Sharon, started the fund to continue Brian’s commitment to the PLAY program. Last year, over 5,300 children received PLAY scholarships to take art classes, attend our summer camps and participate in youth sports.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Thanks to the generosity of the Casey Family, you have the opportunity to double your impact to the PLAY program! Every gift, no matter how small, will be matched by the Casey family.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Help us make a big impact this year and honor Brian’s commitment to the youth in our community!</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://app.etapestry.com/onlineforms/CityofColumbusDBAColumbusRecr/Caseymatch.html?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">Donate to the Brian S. Casey Memorial Fund</a>.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">We thank you beforehand for your consideration and your support.</p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/05/9416281/5423921/sharon-and-brian-casey_crop.jpg" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="Meganand Brian Casey smiling and hugging" width="570" height="426">
